OL,3,GNEWSAWoman braves jellyfish and seals
OL,4,Ato conquer Channel swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who swam the English Channel
OL,7,Falongside seals and through jellyfish
OL,8,Fstings said completing the challenge
OL,9,Fwhile her father with Parkinson's
OL,10,Fdisease could still understand her
OL,11,Fachievement felt like "it was all meant
OL,12,Fto be".
OL,14,FKaren Mee, from Snitterfield, completed
OL,15,Fthe 21-mile (34km) crossing from Dover
OL,16,Fto France in 14 hours and 39 minutes on
OL,17,F4 October, raising almost #17,000 for
OL,18,FParkinson's and brain tumour charities.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
