OL,3,GNEWSAWoman braves jellyfish and seals
OL,4,Ato conquer Channel swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FMee said finishing the swim before her
OL,7,Ffather's condition progressed further
OL,8,Fmade the feat feel even more
OL,9,Fmeaningful.
OL,11,F"It hit home that if it had [got] any
OL,12,Flater, my dad might not have known I'd
OL,13,Fdone it", she added.
